{"name":"Velen","status":"ok","title":"Velen","pageId":14337,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Velen</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Settlement</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cape_Velen\" title=\"Cape Velen\">Velen</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lands_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Lands of Intrigue\">Lands of Intrigue</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">City</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"demonym\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Demonym</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Velean<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI1.T-p57_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI1.T-p57-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Commerce</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"exports\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Exports</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fish\" title=\"Fish\">Fish</a>, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Shellfish (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2hlbGxmaXNoP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">shellfish</span>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whale\" title=\"Whale\">whales</a>, and their byproducts (<a href=\"/wiki/Oil\" title=\"Oil\">oils</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ambergris\" title=\"Ambergris\">ambergris</a>, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Whalebone (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvV2hhbGVib25lP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">whalebone</span>, <a href=\"/wiki/Pearl\" title=\"Pearl\">pearls</a>, etc)</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"government\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Duchy</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">21,000&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1370_DR\" title=\"1370 DR\">1370&#160;DR</a><br>16,000&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Duke Llachior Blackthorn&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1370_DR\" title=\"1370 DR\">1370&#160;DR</a><br>Duke Calchais&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Velen\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Velen\">Inhabitants of  Velen</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Velen\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Locations in Velen\">Locations in  Velen</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Velen\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Velen\">Organizations in  Velen</a></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Velen</b> was a port city on the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Tethyrian peninsula (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGV0aHlyaWFuX3Blbmluc3VsYT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Tethyrian peninsula</span> overlooking the <a href=\"/wiki/Sea_of_Swords\" title=\"Sea of Swords\">Sea of Swords</a>. The coastal city served as the capital of duchy of <a href=\"/wiki/Cape_Velen\" title=\"Cape Velen\">Cape Velen</a>, within the Kingdom of <a href=\"/wiki/Tethyr\" title=\"Tethyr\">Tethyr</a> in the 14<sup>th</sup> century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a> and onward into the 15<sup>th</sup> century after the realm's independence was declared. It was famous for being exceptionally haunted, though this was hardly noticed by the city's citizens.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p191_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p191-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-VGtBGII-p89_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VGtBGII-p89-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Due to its location as one of the western-most coastal cities on the mainland of <a href=\"/wiki/Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Faerûn\">Faerûn</a>, Velen has been a stalwart defender against the pirates of the <a href=\"/wiki/Nelanther_Isles\" title=\"Nelanther Isles\">Nelanther Isles</a>. It has embraced this role for centuries and has maintained a well-trained city guard and formidable naval forces.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VGtBGII-p89_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VGtBGII-p89-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Relations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Relations</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Notable_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Velen?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Velen lay in a shallow bay nestled between two ocean-side hills, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Captain's Cliff (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2FwdGFpbiUyN3NfQ2xpZmY/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Captain's Cliff</span> on the west and <span class=\"new\" title=\"Widow's Hill (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvV2lkb3clMjdzX0hpbGw/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Widow's Hill</span> to the east. The homes of nobility and the wealthy covered both hills.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VGtBGII-p89_3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VGtBGII-p89-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The city was guarded by massive, <a href=\"/wiki/Copper\" title=\"Copper\">copper</a>-colored stone walls that protected both its coast and overland borders. Its wharf was equipped with massive chains, submerged beneath the sea, that could be hoisted to hem the speed and maneuverability of any ships that tried to bombard the city.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p191_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p191-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Velen?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The Velean were a hearty and resourceful people, who by and large, maintained a lighthearted disposition and always seemed to pick themselves up and dust themselves off when faced with adversity.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VGtBGII-p89_3-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VGtBGII-p89-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Ghost\" title=\"Ghost\">Ghosts</a> were a common sight within the city's walls, appearing for a brief moments before disappearing into darkness. The Velean citizens had come to largely ignore these sightings, and disregarded the spectral appearances.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p191_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p191-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Relations\">Relations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Relations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Velen?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Relations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Citizens of <a href=\"/wiki/Zazesspur\" title=\"Zazesspur\">Zazesspur</a> thought the citizens of Velen to be unsophisticated, \"ghost-crazed\" backwoods folk.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VGtBGII-p89_3-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VGtBGII-p89-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Velen?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Prior to the 15<sup>th</sup> century, Velen was a city within the kingdom of <a href=\"/wiki/Tethyr\" title=\"Tethyr\">Tethyr</a>. However, in <a href=\"/wiki/1424_DR\" title=\"1424 DR\">1424 DR</a> they declared their independence from the Forest Nation and became an autonomous duchy. While this declaration created initial tension with Tethyr, over time relations between the two realms were re-established and they considered one another as allies.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p191_2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p191-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Velen?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Blackthorn's Brew (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmxhY2t0aG9ybiUyN3NfQnJldz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Blackthorn's Brew</span>: This luxurious inn offered the best beer and service in the Tethyrian peninsula<sup id=\"cite_ref-VGtBGII-p90_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VGtBGII-p90-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Dolphin's Leap (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRG9scGhpbiUyN3NfTGVhcD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Dolphin's Leap</span>: A temple to <a href=\"/wiki/Valkur\" title=\"Valkur\">Valkur</a> with a silver dolphin on top. The local priests were known to sell sea charts and healing services.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VGtBGII-p95_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VGtBGII-p95-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Morgan's Inn (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTW9yZ2FuJTI3c19Jbm4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Morgan's Inn</span>: A large but very comfortable inn run by the couple, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Gordrith Snowcastle (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR29yZHJpdGhfU25vd2Nhc3RsZT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Gordrith</span> and <span class=\"new\" title=\"Farlorea Snowcastle (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRmFybG9yZWFfU25vd2Nhc3RsZT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Farlorea Snowcastle</span><sup id=\"cite_ref-VGtBGII-p90_4-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VGtBGII-p90-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Shipsgrave_Tower\" title=\"Shipsgrave Tower\">Shipsgrave Tower</a>: A temple to <a href=\"/wiki/Umberlee\" title=\"Umberlee\">Umberlee</a> with a sinister reputation. Rumours hold that Umberlee herself was able to summon lightning from the tower.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VGtBGII-p94_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VGtBGII-p94-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Yardarm\" title=\"The Yardarm\">The Yardarm</a>: A tavern, famous for its dish \"tonguelash\", which included sliced pears.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VGtBGII-p91_7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VGtBGII-p91-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Home_of_the_Stalwarts\" title=\"Home of the Stalwarts\">Home of the Stalwarts</a>: a temple dedicated to <a href=\"/wiki/Helm\" title=\"Helm\">Helm</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-loi-t-58_8-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-loi-t-58-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Velen?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Velen?veaction=edit&section=7\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>Video Games</dt>\n<dd><b><small>Referenced only</small></b></dd>\n<dd><small><i><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_III\" title=\"Baldur's Gate III\">Baldur's Gate III</a></i></small></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-edit